    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39372" root="نجح" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْىٌ نَجِيحٌ</span></b>  <i>Right counsel, advice,</i> or <i>opinion.</i>
(S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْرٌ نَجِيحٌ</span>, (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاجِحٌ</span></b> ,
(K,) (tropical:)  <i>A vehement pace:</i> (K:) <i>a quick pace.</i>
(S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَانٌ نَجِيحٌ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاجِحٌ</span></b> , (assumed tropical:)  <i>A near
place;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشِيكٌ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهْضٌ نَجِيحٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>An
energetic rising,</i> or <i>raising of one's self.</i> (L.)
[You say,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَهَضَ فِى هٰذَا الأَمْر نَهْضًا نَجِيحًا</span> (tropical:)  <i>He
rose quickly to employ himself in this affair.</i>
(A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْجِحٌ</span>.

